v>\n      <div class=\"label\">贝果</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ingredient\" style=\"left:196px; top:452px;\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:56px; height:48px;\">[Photo: 香蕉]</div>\n      <div class=\"label\">香蕉</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ingredient\" style=\"left:266px; top:452px;\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:56px; height:48px;\">[Photo: 可可粉包装]</div>\n      <div class=\"label\">可可粉</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step abs\" style=\"left:38px; top:520px; width:290px;\">\n      2.奶酪加入可可粉，搅拌均匀涂<br>\n      抹在贝果上摆上水果\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- stamp -->\n    <div class=\"stamp\">平安<br>喜乐</div>\n\n    <!-- big finished bagel -->\n    <div class=\"placeholder abs\" style=\"left:346px; top:548px; width:170px; height:130px;\">[Illustration: 完成的香蕉可可贝果，右下方]</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder abs\" style=\"left:300px; top:576px; width:40px; height:26px;\">[Illustration: 香蕉片]</div>\n\n    <!-- process row 2 -->\n    <div class=\"placeholder abs\" style=\"left:38px; top:598px; width:80px; height:52px;\">[Illustration: 搅拌碗]</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder abs\" style=\"left:150px; top:596px; width:80px; height:56px;\">[Illustration: 涂可可奶酪的贝果]</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder abs\" style=\"left:252px; top:594px; width:80px; height:58px;\">[Illustration: 摆上香蕉片的贝果]</div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
